# Conad Tech - Email & Notification Configuration
# To send live emails to isaacaddyasare@gmail.com and caessuman3@gmail.com,
# create a .env.local file in this directory and populate with your credentials:

# Option A: Gmail SMTP with App Password (Recommended for quick setup)
# 1. Go to Google Account > Security > 2-Step Verification > App Passwords
# 2. Generate an App Password for "Conad Tech Website"
GMAIL_USER=your_sending_email@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your_16_char_app_password

# Option B: Standard SMTP (Brevo, SendGrid, Amazon SES, Mailgun, etc.)
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=your_smtp_user
# SMTP_PASS=your_smtp_password
